Q: What is volatile Keyword?
	volatile guarantees visibility of changes across threads.
	private volatile boolean running = true;

	Without volatile :
		Thread may read cached value: and never see updates.

	With volatile :
		Every read happens from main memory.		// All threads immediately see the latest value.
